      "file": "src-tauri/src/file_delivery/search_source.rs",
      "lines": "5-40",
      "conclusion": "DOCX capture logic moved into a private shared helper; expected location/object stamp checked before body, complete 1MiB cap, final full VerifiedFile equality."
    },
    {
      "file": "src-tauri/src/file_delivery.rs",
      "lines": "183-235,238-330",
      "conclusion": "Metadata cap precedes body; take(max+1) rejects growth before SHA. Handle/path/root identity rechecks and complete receipt compare remain intact."
    },
    {
      "file": "src-tauri/src/file_delivery/workbook.rs",
      "lines": "8-25",
      "conclusion": "Old16MiB preview unchanged. New search reads bounded whole source then existing unpack; only XML/rels returned, all archive entries still validated."
    },
    {
      "file": "src-tauri/src/file_delivery_commands.rs",
      "lines": "139-162",
      "conclusion": "Main-view gate precedes actual checked helper; shared run wraps capture and unpack, preserving OS slot lifetime and readBusy/readPending classification."
    },
    {
      "file": "src-tauri/src/file_read_check.rs",
      "lines": "39-81",
      "conclusion": "Two actual blocking operations max; timeout/drop does not release closure-owned permit or claim OS cancellation. Shared mechanism bytes unchanged."
    },
    {
      "file": "src-tauri/src/file_delivery/ooxml_archive.rs",
      "lines": "9-49,111-292",
      "conclusion": "Archive/part/total/entry limits, CRC of ignored members, duplicate/overlap and ZIP64 checks unchanged; TooLarge maps limit, Changed maps changed, outer busy/pending remain distinct."
    }
